    a "如果这能让你好受点，我倒是乐意拿那些号码全换你的一个。"

translate schinese a_story2_d9a74f3d:

    # mc "Heh, thanks Alice."
    mc "嘿，谢谢你，爱丽丝。"

translate schinese a_story2_557d87c6:

    # a "Let's go home. We'll think about my reward later."
    a "我们回家吧。奖励的事晚点再说。"

translate schinese a_story3_5ee8b7b7:

    # mc "Alice is probably in her room, as usual."
    mc "爱丽丝现在大概又在自己房间。"

translate schinese a_story3_94bd6466:

    # mc "I still owe her a reward for winning that pick up bet. Even though she had Riley's help, so it was kind of unfair."
    mc "我还得给她赢得那场搭讪赌局的奖励。虽然有莱利帮忙，说起来有点不公平。"

translate schinese a_story3_da7bf3ca:

    # mc "But I'm a man of my word. I'll ask her what she wants."
    mc "但我是个说话算话的人。我会问她想要什么。"

translate schinese a_story3_96cd6d89:

    # mc "Alice! Can I come in?"
    mc "爱丽丝！我能进来吗？"

translate schinese a_story3_3f350d08:

    # a "Yeah!"
    a "对！"

translate schinese a_story3_7f7287c5:

    # a "Wait!"
    a "等等！"

translate schinese a_story3_39457d69:

    # mc "Too late. I'm already in."
    mc "晚了。我已经进来了。"

translate schinese a_story3_3d573c99:

    # a "Can you bring me something to drink? I'm thirsty as hell."
    a "能给我拿点喝的吗？我渴死了。"

translate schinese a_story3_95924962:

    # mc "Too busy to even go downstairs?"
    mc "忙到连下楼都没空？"

translate schinese a_story3_fce99d55:

    # a "Exactly."
    a "就是说。"

translate schinese a_story3_74ddd231:

    # mc "Be right back."
    mc "马上回来。"

translate schinese a_story3_18d643af:

    # mc "Got you a water."
    mc "给你拿了水。"

translate schinese a_story3_6ad13e34:

    # a "Water? I was hoping for something sweet."
    a "水？我还想要点甜的呢。"

translate schinese a_story3_81f3f4e4:

    # mc "Girl, you barely get any move. Drink water or you're gonna get fat."
    mc "姑娘，你真是毫无自觉。喝水，不然你要胖了。"

translate schinese a_story3_2931cd83:

    # a "Rude."
    a "真没礼貌。"

translate schinese a_story3_d34fa823:

    # a "Ahhh, much better. Thanks."
    a "啊——好多了。谢谢。"

translate schinese a_story3_3c008fce:

    # mc "Sure. I wouldn't want you dying of dehydration on me."
    mc "当然。我可不想你在我这儿脱水而死。"

translate schinese a_story3_d514b3fa:

    # mc "But I won't carry you to the bathroom. You'll have to go yourself."
    mc "但我不会抱你去厕所。你得自己去。"

translate schinese a_story3_a6257f77:

    # a "Good thing you just brought me a bottle then."
    a "还好你只是拿了瓶水过来。"

translate schinese a_story3_a0e739e1:

    # mc "Ew, that was Chad-level humor. Way too gross for you."
    mc "呃，那可是查德级别的笑话。对你来说太恶心了。"

translate schinese a_story3_89d41536:

    # a "G-Gosh. Why did you have to react like that? Couldn't you just laugh?"
    a "呜、呜哇。你干嘛反应那么大？笑一下不就好了吗？"

translate schinese a_story3_e7062557:

    # a "Now I'm embarrassed."
    a "我现在好尴尬。"

translate schinese a_story3_d92a83dc:

    # mc "Anyway, what are you doing?"
    mc "话说，你在干什么？"

translate schinese a_story3_f7968455:

    # a "Oh, I, ummm..."
    a "哦，我，呃……"

translate schinese a_story3_c1ddc4a3:

    # a "Just don't laugh, okay?"
    a "你别笑我，好吗？"

translate schinese a_story3_68b99833:

    # a "I'm making... a game. O-or at least trying to."
    a "我在做……一个游戏。也、或者说是试着做。"

translate schinese a_story3_d69bb18a:

    # mc "Wait, seriously? That's pretty cool actually."
    mc "等等，真的吗？其实挺酷的。"

translate schinese a_story3_0ecfffab:

    # mc "Why would I laught at that?"
    mc "我为什么要笑那个？"

translate schinese a_story3_3256a074:

    # a "I-I don't know, I just said it in case."
    a "我、我不知道，我是以防万一才那么说的。"

translate schinese a_story3_fa2edf76:

    # mc "You never mentioned this before. Did you start recently?"
    mc "你以前从没提过这事。你是最近才开始的吗？"

translate schinese a_story3_4323c0df:

    # a "Yeah, but I've been thinking about it for a while."
    a "对，不过我想了很久了。"

translate schinese a_story3_c09d467b:

    # a "I mean, is there even a single person who plays games and never once thought about making their own?"
    a "我是说，玩游戏的人里，难道就没有一个从没想过自己做一款的吗？"

translate schinese a_story3_0af0798b:

    # mc "I never thought about it."
    mc "我从没想过。"

translate schinese a_story3_6c8ddf4e:

    # a "I meant... you know, {i}real{/i} gamers. As cringy as that term is."
    a "我是说……你懂的，{i}真正的{/i}玩家。虽然这词挺中二的。"

translate schinese a_story3_b8f50550:

    # mc "Yeah, it kinda is."
    mc "嗯，好像是有点。"

translate schinese a_story3_06d5d1b1:

    # mc "But isn't it like, super hard? I don't know much about it, but that's what I heard."
    mc "但那不是超级难吗？我不太懂，不过我听说是这样。"

translate schinese a_story3_a54ca011:

    # a "I'm not doing anything complicated. I'm not planning to sell it. It's just for my own satisfaction."
    a "我不做什么复杂的东西。也不打算卖，只是为了自己爽。"

translate schinese a_story3_13cb06cd:

    # a "Maybe I'll upload it online later. If I'm happy with the final result."
    a "如果最后做出来我满意，也许会传到网上。"

translate schinese a_story3_d70149c2:

    # mc "I get it. And what kind of game is it?"
    mc "我懂了。是哪种类型的游戏？"

translate schinese a_story3_b2addd64:

    # a "Just a simple visual novel."
    a "就是一个简单的视觉小说。"

translate schinese a_story3_d766155e:

    # mc "Visual novel? That is... ummm... something like a book with pictures where you press a button instead of turning pages?"
    mc "视觉小说？就是那种……呃……有图的书，只不过不用翻页而是按按钮？"

translate schinese a_story3_47fe254c:

    # a "Well, there's a bit more nuance to it, but that definition should be safe for your brain."
    a "嗯，其实还有点门道，不过这个定义对你的脑子来说应该够用了。"

translate schinese a_story3_3e271093:

    # mc "Thanks for looking out, but my brain is doing just fine."
    mc "谢谢你关心，但我的脑子好得很。"

translate schinese a_story3_6c6e87a2:

    # mc "So what do we have here?"
    mc "那给我看看现在是什么样？"

translate schinese a_story3_768421b6:

    # mc "Her: \"Hey, I found your letter.\" \nHim: \"Hey, I'm glad.\""
    mc "她：「嘿，我找到你的信了。」 \n他：「嘿，我真高兴。」"

translate schinese a_story3_dd6e6a9e:

    # mc "Her: \"Why did you want me to come here?\" \nHim: \"I wanted to ask if you'll be my girlfriend?\""
    mc "她：「你为什么叫我来这里？」 \n他：「我想问你愿不愿意做我的女朋友？」"

translate schinese a_story3_e59ebd7a:

    # mc "Her surprised: \"Oh. Yes, I'd love to!\""
    mc "她惊讶地说：「哦。好啊，我愿意！」"

translate schinese a_story3_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

translate schinese a_story3_e4d149fc:

    # mc "Pfff! Hahahaha!"
    mc "噗！哈哈哈哈哈！"

translate schinese a_story3_5cf41ced:

    # a "H-Hey!!"
    a "喂、喂！！"

translate schinese a_story3_2e5a09c4:

    # a "You said you wouldn't laugh!"
    a "你说过不会笑的！"

translate schinese a_story3_abbf5204:

    # mc "Sorry, sorry! It was just hilarious."
    mc "对不起对不起！实在太好笑了。"

translate schinese a_story3_a0ecbf07:

    # a "Grrr! I'm not showing you anything else. I'm turning it off!"
    a "呃！我再也不给你看了。我要关掉！"

translate schinese a_story3_241650b5:

    # mc "No, no. Wait!"
    mc "不不，等等！"

translate schinese a_story3_5f14d862:

    # mc "I'm sorry, I won't do it again. I was just surprised by how... dry and stiff the dialogue is."
    mc "对不起，我不会再这样了。我只是惊讶于你的对白有多……干巴又僵硬。"

translate schinese a_story3_df4f1923:

    # a "It's just a draft, okay? I know it sucks."
    a "这只是草稿，好吗？我知道很烂。"

translate schinese a_story3_9523b1d5:

    # mc "But romance? Seriously?"
    mc "可这是爱情故事？认真的吗？"

translate schinese a_story3_e0020267:

    # mc "That's probably the last genre I expected from you."
    mc "这大概是我最想不到你会写的类型。"

translate schinese a_story3_32ce977a:

    # a "It's just one scene. It's not only romance, there's more stuff."
    a "只是一段场景而已。不只有爱情，还有别的东西。"

translate schinese a_story3_8677b8f7:

    # mc "I hope the other parts are a bit better. Though that wouldn't be hard."
    mc "希望其他部分能好点。不过那应该不难。"

translate schinese a_story3_819c6011:

    # a "I know, I know! It's awful. I'm fully aware."
    a "我知道我知道！很烂。我完全清楚。"

translate schinese a_story3_3990d2c1:

    # a "How would you write it, huh? Since your brain is apparently working so great, you must have tons of brilliant ideas."
    a "换成你怎么写啊？既然你脑子明明这么灵光，肯定有一堆绝妙点子吧。"

translate schinese a_story3_ad909a8e:

    # mc "Hmmm..."
    mc "嗯……"

translate schinese a_story3_bd95a1e4:

    # mc "This guy should have way more confidence. He needs to dominate her with his presence."
    mc "这个男的应该自信得多。他得用气势压住她。"

translate schinese a_story3_dd464070:

    # mc "I'll show you what I mean. Stand by the cabinet."
    mc "我给你演示一下。到柜子旁边站着。"

translate schinese a_story3_984450fb:

    # a "Okay, what now?"
    a "好，然后呢？"

translate schinese a_story3_6f57f385:

    # mc "The hero should pin her against the wall and block her escape route with his arm. On top of that he should be staring deep into her eyes the whole time."
    mc "男主应该把她按在墙上，用手臂封住她的退路。而且全程都要深深盯着她的眼睛。"

translate schinese a_story3_755876db:

    # mc "Alice, will you go out with me?"
    mc "爱丽丝，你愿意跟我交往吗？"

translate schinese a_story3_c395b529:

    # a "Y-Yes."
    a "好、好的。"

translate schinese a_story3_4e46e73d:

    # mc "See? Even though you knew exactly what I was gonna say, you still stuttered."
    mc "看？明明知道我要说什么，你还是结巴了。"

translate schinese a_story3_c3a15f43:

    # mc "It just works. Confidence is the best thing when talking to girls. Plus you look cool as hell doing it."
    mc "这招就是好使。跟女孩说话，自信是最重要的。而且你这么做的时候帅得要死。"

translate schinese a_story3_2b50d32c:

    # mc "Remember that. Romances need to be intense. Got it?"
    mc "记住。爱情故事就得有张力。懂了吗？"

translate schinese a_story3_f453d822:

    # a "Y-Yeah... I think I get it."
    a "好、好的……我好像懂了。"

translate schinese a_story3_53de35f9:

    # a "(Jesus Christ. My heart is pounding like crazy.)"
    a "（天啊。我的心脏跳得厉害。）"

translate schinese a_story3_701dc93b:

    # mc "You should add some emotion to it. It's a confession, so it should be a little awkward. Best if it's in a different situation too."
    mc "你应该加点情绪进去。既然是告白，就该有点笨拙。最好换个场景。"

translate schinese a_story3_a54a01dd:

    # mc "Come on, stand in the middle of the room."
    mc "来，站到房间中间。"

translate schinese a_story3_24f893c8:

    # mc "Imagine we're both walking down the hallway right now."
    mc "想象一下我们现在一起走在走廊上。"

translate schinese a_story3_32b9ef60:

    # a "What are you...?"
    a "你在说什……？"

translate schinese a_story3_10674add:

    # mc "Suddenly, we bump into each other and bang our heads together."
    mc "突然，我们撞在一起，脑袋磕到了一块。"

translate schinese a_story3_90d3f7ad:

    # mc "You were staring at your phone, which drops to the ground, and I... I don't know, let's say I drop my water bottle."
    mc "你正低头看手机，手机掉到地上，然后我……我不知道，就设定成我的水瓶掉了。"

translate schinese a_story3_a44183c3:

    # a "O-Okay. And then what?"
    a "好、好的。然后呢？"

translate schinese a_story3_ee9e3e6f:

    # mc "We're both sitting on the floor rubbing our foreheads, and then I, the game protagonist, realize who I just ran into. The girl I like."
    mc "我们俩坐在地上揉额头，然后我，这个游戏主角，认出了刚才撞到的人——我喜欢的女孩。"

translate schinese a_story3_795303f9:

    # mc "I apologize, start panicking a little, and once things calm down I mumble something like: \"I-I don't know if anyone's ever told you this, but... y-you have.. a really nice hoodie\"."
    mc "我道了歉，开始有点慌乱，等平静下来，我小声嘟囔：『我、我不知道有没有人跟你说过，不过……你、你那件卫衣……真好看』。"

translate schinese a_story3_b612480f:

    # a "\"You have a nice hoodie\"? But that was supposed to be a confession."
    a "『你卫衣真好看』？可那本来应该是告白啊。"

translate schinese a_story3_e1f39514:

    # mc "That's just the start. The point is to build that awkward vibe first."
    mc "那只是开头。重点是先营造出那种笨拙的氛围。"

translate schinese a_story3_759af8e7:

    # mc "I bet in a moment like that the player would be internally screaming at the screen for the guy to finally spit it out."
    mc "我敢打赌，碰到这种场面，玩家一定在心里对着屏幕吼，让那男的赶紧把话说出口。"

translate schinese a_story3_e94fddf3:

    # mc "It's all about emotions. If you add emotion to the game, you'll trigger it in the players too."
    mc "一切都靠情绪。你在游戏里注入情绪，玩家也会被带动起来。"

translate schinese a_story3_2693b37a:

    # a "Wow. That actually sounded surprisingly smart."
    a "哇。听起来意外地有道理。"

translate schinese a_story3_6af2fe67:

    # mc "Told you, my brain is in peak condition."
    mc "我说过了，我的大脑正处于巅峰状态。"

translate schinese a_story3_27986ef5:

    # mc "It's a game, so you should surprise the player with something."
    mc "这是游戏，所以得用点什么让玩家惊喜。"

translate schinese a_story3_f7da4b06:

    # mc "And there's no better way to do that than comedy, or even parody."
    mc "而最好的方式就是喜剧，甚至恶搞。"

translate schinese a_story3_7301a738:

    # a "You think so?"
    a "你真这么想？"

translate schinese a_story3_05835220:

    # mc "Of course. Just imagine this."
    mc "当然。你想象一下。"

translate schinese a_story3_9ee0b0ff:

    # mc "She arrives at the meeting spot, but he's not there."
    mc "她到了约好的地方，他却不在。"

translate schinese a_story3_7adfe80b:

    # mc "She looks around for a bit, then suddenly his head appears hanging from a tree."
    mc "她四处找了一会儿，突然一棵树杈上倒挂着一颗脑袋。"

translate schinese a_story3_e90d35ea:

    # mc "She screams, and he greets her with some incredibly stupid line."
    mc "她尖叫起来，他就用一句蠢到极点的话跟她打招呼。"

translate schinese a_story3_95b806ef:

    # mc "Then he tries to move to the confession, but suddenly falls out of the tree, hits his head, and passes out."
    mc "然后他正要说告白，却突然从树上掉下来，撞到头，昏了过去。"

translate schinese a_story3_d87d31e6:

    # mc "She calls an ambulance and rides with him. He wakes up in the back and confesses his love right there."
    mc "她叫了救护车，还跟着上了车。他在救护车后座醒来，当场就告白了。"

translate schinese a_story3_bb8e4b4e:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

translate schinese a_story3_db4d95d8:

    # a "That sounds stupid."
    a "听起来好蠢。"

translate schinese a_story3_00c5a493:

    # mc "Exactly!"
    mc "没错！"

translate schinese a_story3_205df977:

    # mc "It's supposed to sound stupid. Some people love that level of stupidity."
    mc "本来就该听着蠢。就有人好这一口。"

translate schinese a_story3_18365fcc:

    # mc "It's definitely better than that dry-ass text you wrote."
    mc "肯定比你写的那段干巴巴的台词强。"

translate schinese a_story3_f36161d2:

    # a "Shut up."
    a "闭嘴。"

translate schinese a_story3_486c884b:

    # a "Aaaaaah! This is all so pointless!"
    a "啊啊啊！这全都太没意义了！"

translate schinese a_story3_5726b779:

    # a "The truth is, I'm just completely terrible at this. I can't write plots, characters, dialogues. Nothing."
    a "说实话，我在这方面糟透了。我不会写剧情、不会写人物、不会写对白。什么都不会。"

translate schinese a_story3_aa70c755:

    # mc "Hey, don't give up. Nobody's good at everything right from the start. Give yourself more time."
    mc "喂，别放弃。没有谁能一开始就样样都行的。给自己多点时间。"

translate schinese a_story3_d072ba24:

    # mc "I'm sure the guys who make the games you like had the same problems."
    mc "我敢肯定，你喜欢的那些游戏的作者当初也遇到同样的问题。"

translate schinese a_story3_d56864d0:

    # a "I don't know. My writing is just... tasteless. Like that water you brought me."
    a "我不知道。我的文笔就是……很没品。就像你刚才拿来的那瓶水一样。"

translate schinese a_story3_2345f776:

    # mc "Well... Not everyone was born to be a writer."
    mc "嗯……不是每个人天生都是当作者的料。"

translate schinese a_story3_dd18b1c2:

    # a "Thanks."
    a "谢了。"

translate schinese a_story3_d1a8ee72:

    # a "Why are you even here anyway?"
    a "话说你到底来干什么？"

translate schinese a_story3_a4e808fe:

    # mc "Oh, um, I was bored and thought I'd check in on you."
    mc "哦，呃，我闲着没事，就想过来看看你。"

translate schinese a_story3_21a77abd:

    # mc "I also remembered that I owe you a reward for winning that bet. The one with the phone numbers."
    mc "我还想起我欠你赢得那场赌局的奖励。就是打电话码那个。"

translate schinese a_story3_32123a8f:

    # a "Ah, right. I'd already forgotten about it."
    a "啊，对哦。我都忘了。"

translate schinese a_story3_8f6c9a1e:

    # mc "Good for you I have a good memory."
    mc "还好我记性好。"

translate schinese a_story3_245f6bac:

    # mc "So? Is there something you want? Any wish?"
    mc "所以呢？有什么想要的吗？随便许愿。"

translate schinese a_story3_5c4d1a1e:

    # a "Yeah, become my writer. Write the script for me."
    a "嗯，你来当我的编剧。帮我写剧本。"

translate schinese a_story3_606e2d02:

    # mc "Sure."
    mc "好。"

translate schinese a_story3_d276c87c:

    # a "Yeah, I know. I was just kidding."
    a "嗯，我知道。我开玩笑的。"

translate schinese a_story3_bb8e4b4e_1:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

translate schinese a_story3_6024c2d0:

    # a "Wait, what?"
    a "等等，什么？"

translate schinese a_story3_606e2d02_1:

    # mc "Sure."
    mc "好。"

translate schinese a_story3_10250058:

    # a "You're serious?"
    a "你是认真的？"

translate schinese a_story3_26deded6:

    # mc "But fair warning, I have zero experience with this. I might even be worse than you."
    mc "不过先说好，我这方面一点经验都没有。可能比你还差。"

translate schinese a_story3_ea632e73:

    # a "Come on. That one idea you just threw out already showed you're better at it."
    a "得了吧。你刚才随口说的那个点子，已经证明你比我强了。"

translate schinese a_story3_ffc2a7c5:

    # a "But seriously... will you help me?"
    a "不过说真的……你会帮我吗？"

translate schinese a_story3_333e9284:

    # mc "You won the bet, so I can't say no."
    mc "你赢了赌局，我不能拒绝。"

translate schinese a_story3_0fe3f176:

    # mc "Though honestly, I'd probably help you even if you didn't use your reward on this."
    mc "不过说真的，就算你不用奖励换这个，我大概也会帮你。"

translate schinese a_story3_276988d1:

    # a "Oh shit. Can I take it back then?"
    a "靠。那我能收回吗？"

translate schinese a_story3_07702a49:

    # mc "Nope. Too late now."
    mc "不行。已经太晚了。"

translate schinese a_story3_a59b7689:

    # a "{sc=1}Mmmm!"
    a "{sc=1}嗯哼！"

translate schinese a_story3_2c1088a9:

    # a "Fine. I won't complain. I'm actually happy you're helping."
    a "好吧。我不抱怨了。其实你愿意帮我我很高兴。"

translate schinese a_story3_dc31b934:

    # mc "Wanna sit down and work on it now?"
    mc "要不要现在坐下来开始弄？"

translate schinese a_story3_46c17595:

    # a "Sure!"
    a "没问题！"

translate schinese a_story3_ce1ac71d:

    # mc "Alright then. What else do you have besides that awful confession scene?"
    mc "那好吧。除了那段烂告白，你还有别的吗？"

translate schinese a_story3_ee5692e1:

    # a "You're awful."
    a "你好讨厌。"

translate schinese a_story3_9344338e:

    # a "Not much. A few fragments from different scenes. I was planning to connect them somehow later."
    a "不多。都是从不同场景里攒下来的碎片。我本来打算之后再想办法把它们连起来。"

translate schinese a_story3_12f9a09d:

    # mc "So basically you've got almost nothing?"
    mc "所以基本上你几乎什么都没有？"

translate schinese a_story3_ed61e773:

    # a "Pretty much."
    a "差不多吧。"

translate schinese a_story3_6fa32449:

    # mc "{i}*Sigh...*{/i} This is gonna be a long road."
    mc "{i}*叹气……*{/i} 这下可有得忙了。"

translate schinese a_story3_acb6d853:

    # mc "You already decided it's a romance, but is it supposed to be like a pure romance? Nothing else?"
    mc "你都已经定了是爱情故事，但难道是纯爱情？别的什么都没有？"

translate schinese a_story3_39243442:

    # a "No, that would be boring. There needs to be some other plotline to drive the story."
    a "不，那太无聊了。还得有一条别的线索来推动故事。"

translate schinese a_story3_7c07bfdf:

    # a "The story {i}you're{/i} going to come up with."
    a "那条{i}你{/i}要想出来的故事线。"

translate schinese a_story3_baa10e48:

    # mc "{i}Together{/i} with you. I'm not doing all the work myself. It's your game."
    mc "跟我{i}一起{/i}。我可不打算全干了。这是你的游戏。"

translate schinese a_story3_a8a086cf:

    # a "I'll put you in the credits."
    a "我会把你写进制作名单里。"

translate schinese a_story3_32cd3936:

    # mc "What an honor."
    mc "真是荣幸。"

translate schinese a_story3_370e5dd3:

    # mc "Anyway, we need to add something that'll make the whole thing more interesting."
    mc "总之，我们得加点什么，让整个东西变得更有意思。"

translate schinese a_story3_81206d10:

    # mc "What do you think about adding some fantasy elements? You've played a ton of games, so you should know this stuff pretty well."
    mc "你觉得加点奇幻元素怎么样？你玩过那么多游戏，应该挺懂这些。"

translate schinese a_story3_5a48abc5:

    # a "Ooh, that could be cool. Maybe magic, or some giant creatures."
    a "哦，那可能挺酷的。比如魔法，或者某种巨型生物。"

translate schinese a_story3_5c3f1f02:

    # mc "Well, if we can fit them into the story in a way that actually makes sense, then why not?"
    mc "嗯，只要能以一种真正说得通的方式融进故事里，为什么不呢？"

translate schinese a_story3_5e4b52b7:

    # a "Or something way simpler. Like, the heroine can see affection meters floating above people's heads, but for some reason it doesn't work on one particular guy."
    a "或者搞个简单得多的。比如女主能看到别人头顶飘着好感度，但不知道为什么对某个男的就失灵了。"

translate schinese a_story3_719cbe6c:

    # a "That could be the main reason why she gets curious about him."
    a "这可能就是她对他产生好奇心的主要原因。"

translate schinese a_story3_6934699d:

    # mc "Hey, see? You're already coming up with pretty good stuff."
    mc "嘿，你看？你已经能想出挺不错的东西了。"

translate schinese a_story3_81cbaaea:

    # mc "A solid idea and suddenly the work starts doing itself."
    mc "一个好点子一来，活的自己就开始干了。"

translate schinese a_story3_7721e4ee:

    # a "True."
    a "没错。"

translate schinese a_story3_13a038f9:

    # mc "How about setting it in a sci-fi world? That opens up way more possibilities."
    mc "把舞台设成科幻世界怎么样？那样可能性多得多。"

translate schinese a_story3_d7cea980:

    # a "That sounds like a ton of work for the graphics though. Backgrounds, lights, neons, holograms... there's quite a bit of that."
    a "不过听起来美术工作量很大。背景、灯光、霓虹、全息投影……这类东西不少。"

translate schinese a_story3_6ec14fcd:

    # mc "Yeah, but think about the theme. You could do something like… hmm, I don't know. Maybe some kind of tech that blocks people's emotions?"
    mc "对，但想想主题啊。可以做成那种……嗯，我也不知道。也许某种能屏蔽人类情感的科技？"

translate schinese a_story3_fbcba7d9:

    # a "Ah, that could actually be interesting. The plot could focus on trying to break through or disable whatever's blocking them."
    a "啊，那个其实挺有意思的。剧情可以围绕怎么突破或关掉那个屏蔽装置展开。"

translate schinese a_story3_d51d1daf:

    # mc "Yeah, that sound nice."
    mc "嗯，听起来不错。"

translate schinese a_story3_ae95970a:

    # a "Okay, I like it."
    a "好，我喜欢这个。"

translate schinese a_story3_8a73f872:

    # mc "How about post-apo? You know, surviving together while the world ends? Zombies, for example."
    mc "末日题材怎么样？比如世界毁灭之际一起求生之类的？拿僵尸来说。"

translate schinese a_story3_f1999606:

    # a "Isn't that a bit overdone? Zombies have been in pretty much everything."
    a "那不是有点用滥了吗？僵尸都快成万能题材了。"

translate schinese a_story3_9540f0ca:

    # mc "That's just one example. The world can end for tons of different reasons. I don't know, the sun suddenly goes out."
    mc "那只是一个例子。世界毁灭的原因多了去了。比如太阳突然熄灭了。"

translate schinese a_story3_ac1f2d74:

    # a "I heard people would die really fast if that happened."
    a "我听说那样的话人会死得很快。"

translate schinese a_story3_80f2c3dd:

    # mc "It's just a game, they can die a little slower in it. Long enough for some sparks to fly between the main characters, at least."
    mc "这只是个游戏，让他们死得慢点也行。至少够男女主角之间擦出点火花。"

translate schinese a_story3_9dca8c51:

    # a "Hmmm, okay. I'll admit it doesn't sound half bad."
    a "嗯……好吧。我承认听起来还不赖。"

translate schinese a_story3_e1d88973:

    # mc "Alright, let's start writing something. We'll need some basics to build on."
    mc "好，开始写点东西吧。我们得先有些基本框架。"

translate schinese a_story3_7fa5b48d:

    # a "Will you help me rework the stuff I already have? You know, the part you roasted so quickly?"
    a "你愿意帮我把已有的部分重写一遍吗？就是刚才被你秒批的那部分。"

translate schinese a_story3_f7bccd01:

    # mc "Nope. We're starting from scratch."
    mc "不行。我们从零开始。"

translate schinese a_story3_6f68f448:

    # a "Whaaaat?"
    a "什——么？"

translate schinese a_story3_00b1fc3a:

    # "{i}For the next few hours, Alice's room was filled with nothing but the sound of keyboard clacking and your quiet voices.{/i}"
    "{i}接下来的几个小时里，爱丽丝的房间里只剩下键盘的敲击声和你们轻轻的说话声。{/i}"

translate schinese a_story3_3359ca9e:

    # "{i}When, after a few hours, Alice's head dropped so suddenly she almost hit the keyboard, you decided it was time to end the first dev session.{/i}"
    "{i}几小时后，爱丽丝的脑袋突然一垂，差点砸到键盘上，你便决定结束这第一次开发。{/i}"

translate schinese a_story3_6d396ec8:

    # "{i}You went back to your room and hit the bed.{/i}"
    "{i}你回到自己房间，一头栽倒在床上。{/i}"

